ations:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned} & 2{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}+4{x}_{3}=-1 \\\\  & {x}_{2}+2{x}_{3}=-3 \\\\  & -{x}_{3}=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535889 true] [17592186372749 1113 #uuid "5d1052d8-b940-5719-aa2e-19c644ae92d1" 13194139535889 true] [17592186372749 1145 "The third equation states that \n\n$$\n-{x}_{3}=-1\\,⟹\\,{x}_{3}=1.\n$$\n\n Substituting this into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n{x}_{2}+2(1)=-3\\,⟹\\,{x}_{2}=-3-2=-5.\n$$\n\nNow, we substitute ${x}_{3}=1$ and ${x}_{2}=-5$ into the first equation to get\n\n$$\n2{x}_{1}-(-5)+4(1)=-1\\,⟹\\,{x}_{1}=\\frac{-1-5-4}{2}=-5.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is \n${x}_{1}=-5$, ${x}_{2}=-5$, and ${x}_{3}=1.$  In vector form, the solution can be written as $[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].$" 13194139535889 true] [17592186372750 1000 #edb/ref 17592186372751 13194139535889 true] [17592186372750 1000 #edb/ref 17592186372752 13194139535889 true] [17592186372750 1000 #edb/ref 17592186372753 13194139535889 true] [17592186372750 1000 #edb/ref 17592186372754 13194139535889 true] [17592186372750 1000 #edb/ref 17592186372755 13194139535889 true] [17592186372750 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535889 true] [17592186372750 1041 "selection" 13194139535889 true] [17592186372750 1104 #edb/ref 17592186372754 13194139535889 true] [17592186372750 1110 #uuid "9d7242f2-abd2-5f4c-9efd-694337604ec4" 13194139535889 true] [17592186372751 1034 "[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139535889 true] [17592186372751 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535889 true] [17592186372751 1111 #uuid "edde1daa-43e1-52f2-bc29-7dce970ebd59" 13194139535889 true] [17592186372752 1034 "[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139535889 true] [17592186372752 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535889 true] [17592186372752 1111 #uuid "c86e3014-6330-5697-b969-c49ca1976872" 13194139535889 true] [17592186372753 1034 "[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139535889 true] [17592186372753 1103